{"id":"5ba20ee86fa7998c","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-canonical-truth.md","title":"Truth Lemma for a Normal Canonical Model","display":"lem-canonical-truth — Truth Lemma for a Normal Canonical Model","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-canonical-truth","aliases":["89-lem-canonical-truth"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-canonical-truth — Truth Lemma for a Normal Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-lem-canonical-successor]]","[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-canonical-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-canonical-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-canonical-truth — Truth Lemma for a Normal Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f2c4a3e09c03374\" href=\"?note=4f2c4a3e09c03374\" title=\"89-lem-canonical-successor\">89-lem-canonical-successor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92c4449a6fa3b997\" href=\"?note=92c4449a6fa3b997\" title=\"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties\">89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)\">\\(\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in W_L\">\\(\\Gamma\\in W_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 为局部模态真值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M_L,\\Gamma\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M_L,\\Gamma\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 86–87；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对实际构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,p,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,p,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\\)</span> 归纳。底、否定和合取由极大一致性性质，字母由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_L\">\\(V_L\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box B\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box B\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，每个可及世界含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，归纳假设给盒真。若盒不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>，后继见证提供含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg B\">\\(\\neg B\\)</span> 的可及世界，使盒假。这个一般真值引理只验证固定赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_L\">\\(V_L\\)</span>，不自动证明典范框架在任意赋值下验证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-canonical-successor","status":"resolved","id":"4f2c4a3e09c03374","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-canonical-successor]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties","status":"resolved","id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in W_L","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M_L,\\Gamma\\models A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot,p,\\neg,\\land,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"V_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box B\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg B","display":false},{"tex":"V_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1289,"backlinks":[{"id":"70714818ed137ea4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5bc3d5ff97b8f74","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["c922518c30c4107d","9f00301866fbd6f0","4f2c4a3e09c03374","92c4449a6fa3b997"]}